    "isolation_rule": "Never mount or expose this reference directory to the parser or model under test.",
    "scoring_rule": "Score normalized fields before human correction. Null is not numeric zero. A document recognizer must not copy values from the procurement requirement, V1, manifests, or managed supplier context.",
